<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico to auction 3.0 bln pesos of Cetes.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico to auction 3.0 bln pesos of Cetes.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico said it would auction 3.0 billion pesos worth of Cetes at its primary auction on Tuesday next week.</p>
<p>It will also auction 900 million pesos of Bondes and 500 million UDIs of UDI bonos.</p>
<p>CETES</p>
<p>    Terms	  Amount	   Fixed rates:</p>
<p>    28  days     800 million pesos  19.65 pct</p>
<p>    91  days     800 million pesos  18.71 pct</p>
<p>    182 days     800 million pesos  18.63 pct</p>
<p>    357 days     600 million pesos  17.46 pct</p>
<p>BONDES</p>
<p>    728 days     900 million pesos  100.0 pct</p>
<p>UDIBONOS</p>
<p>    1,036 days   250 million UDIs    99.98871</p>
<p>    1,764 days   250 million UDIs    99.98871</p>
<p>((--Robert Kozak, Mexico City newsroom 525 728-7902))</p>
